{"candidateAnswer":"Having interesting encounters while out in public with people who need directions","evidence":"[D11:6 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Evan: I do my favorite watercolor painting to keep me busy. It's a chill way to relax and get into the colors. By the way, something happened two weeks ago! You're not gonna believe this, I had a bit of an adventure recently. Helped a lost tourist find their way, and we ended up taking an unexpected tour around the city. It was a blast!\n[D14:2 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear about that. Gastritis can be tough. Taking care of ourselves is important. BTW, I've been focusing on fitness and it's been really beneficial for my overall well-being. Funny thing, I had another encounter with a lost tourist recently. Seems like helping tourists is becoming a recurring theme in my life!","itemId":"urn:uuid:aab246de-094a-5a77-a818-905c8768c7fa","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4e7afdba6c751b82da76688eb37d4333e848e56c71ca6ae3f7cdf63fd2897b1e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What recurring adventure does Evan have with strangers?","referenceAnswer":"Helping lost tourists and experiencing unexpected adventures in the city.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4e7afdba6c751b82da76688eb37d4333e848e56c71ca6ae3f7cdf63fd2897b1e"}}]}